  "description": "When Su-Hyeon, who was just a kid back then, had a look on his face as if he was tired of the world, Ji-Ho couldn’t just leave him like that. Their unexpected meeting was followed by a reunion seven years later, at Su-Hyeon's father's funeral. Despite the seven-year gap, they quickly grew close as if they were always brothers. However, even with the eight-year age difference, Ji-Ho, who found himself attracted to Su-Hyeon, started pushing him away out of guilt...\n\n *\"Hyung. You kept staring at me earlier outside.\"\n\"...\"\n\"I can show you more closely.\"*\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
